    id: "cpp-database-access", slug: "cpp-database-access", language: "cpp", category: "languages", title: "Database Access in C++", description: "Access databases from C++: SQL, prepared statements, transactions, connection pooling, and migrations.", difficulty: "Advanced", estimatedHours: 16, skills: ["SQL", "Prepared statements", "Transactions", "Connection pooling", "Modern C++", "Debugging", "Testing", "Performance tuning"], prerequisites: ["C++ Programming: From First Program to Modern C++"], analogy: "Learning {topic} is like learning to use a library archive: you ask precise questions and handle the answers carefully.",
